              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shameless nation, come to your senses ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before you are driven away like chaff blown by the wind, before the burning anger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " comes upon you, before the day when he shows his fury. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", all you humble people of the land, who obey his commands. Do what is right, and humble yourselves before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Perhaps you will escape punishment on the day when the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shows his anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
