                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one will be left in the city of Gaza. Ashkelon will be deserted. The people of Ashdod will be driven out in half a day,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in half a day",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "by a surprise attack at noon.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and the people of Ekron will be driven from their city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You Philistines are doomed, you people who live along the coast. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has passed sentence on you. He will destroy you, and not one of you will be left. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your land by the sea will become open fields with shepherds' huts and sheep pens. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Judah who survive will occupy your land. They will pasture their flocks there and sleep in the houses of Ashkelon. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God will be with them and make them prosper again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
